\title{CDALabeller: Label Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images}
\description{
An app for labelling cell death areas in photographs of agroinfiltrated
leaves. You draw a square around each area and give it a treatment and a
score from 0 to 6. The app saves the squares as a CSV file that
'AutoCDAScorer' can read.
}
